271	33	Present Perfect - Complete Guide	Form: have/has + past participle	Formación del Present Perfect:\n\nAfirmativo:\n- I/You/We/They have + past participle\n- He/She/It has + past participle\n\nNegativo: haven't / hasn't + past participle\nPregunta: Have/Has + subject + past participle?\n\nPast Participle:\n- Regulares: verb + ed (worked, played)\n- Irregulares: tercera columna (gone, seen, eaten)\n\nContracciones: I've, you've, he's, she's, we've, they've	I have finished my homework. She has lived here for 5 years.	\N	"Have you seen this movie? She's never been to Japan."	"I have finish. \\u274c She has went. \\u274c"	"Usar infinitivo o pasado simple en lugar del participio."	He's can ser "he is" o "he has" - el contexto aclara.	1	2026-02-04 04:56:29.701306
