COPY public.motivational_messages (id, title, content, icon, unit_id, "order", is_active) FROM stdin;
1	Enfoque en el Proceso	No busques perfección inmediata. Enfócate en mejorar cada día un poco más.	🪴	\N	0	t
2	Autoempatía	Si hoy te equivocas, no pasa nada. Estás entrenando tu cerebro, no tomando un examen final.	🤝	\N	1	t
3	Micro‑metas	Divide el aprendizaje en pasos pequeños. 5 nuevas palabras hoy es mejor que 0.	🎯	\N	2	t
4	Confianza en tu Voz	Hablar imperfecto es normal. Tu cerebro aprende cuando practicas en voz alta.	🗣️	\N	3	t
5	Lectura Estratégica	No necesitas entender cada palabra. Enfócate en la idea principal.	📌	\N	4	t
6	Constancia	Un poco cada día vence a mucho una sola vez. La disciplina gana.	📅	\N	5	t
7	Mentalidad Positiva	Si te cuesta, significa que estás avanzando. Lo fácil no cambia tu nivel.	💡	\N	6	t
8	Curiosidad	Explora temas que te gusten en inglés. La curiosidad acelera el aprendizaje.	🔍	\N	7	t
9	Growth Mindset	Every mistake is a learning opportunity. The more you practice, the better you become!	🌱	\N	1	t
10	Persistence	Success is not final, failure is not fatal: it is the courage to continue that counts.	💪	\N	2	t
11	Progress	You don't have to be perfect, you just have to be better than yesterday.	📈	\N	3	t
12	Consistency	Small daily improvements lead to stunning results. Keep going!	⭐	\N	4	t
13	Belief	Believe you can and you're halfway there.	✨	\N	5	t
14	Language Learning	Every word you learn is a bridge to new connections and opportunities.	🌍	\N	6	t
15	Practice	The more you use English, the more natural it becomes. Don't be afraid to make mistakes!	🎯	\N	7	t
16	Vocabulary	Learning 5 new words every day means 1,825 new words in a year!	📚	\N	8	t
17	Speaking	Your accent is a sign that you're brave enough to learn another language.	🗣️	\N	9	t
18	Listening	Watch movies, listen to podcasts - immersion is the fastest way to learn!	🎧	\N	10	t
19	You've Got This!	Remember: native speakers were once beginners too!	👊	\N	11	t
20	Keep Going	Fluency is not a destination, it's a journey. Enjoy the ride!	🚀	\N	12	t
21	Celebrate	Look how far you've come! Every lesson completed is a victory.	🎉	\N	13	t
22	Patience	Language learning is a marathon, not a sprint. Take your time and enjoy!	🏃	\N	14	t
23	Effort	The effort you put in today builds the skills you'll use tomorrow.	💎	\N	15	t
24	Study Tip	Studying for 20 minutes every day is better than 2 hours once a week.	💡	\N	16	t
25	Memory Tip	Teach what you learn to someone else - it's the best way to remember!	🧠	\N	17	t
26	Fun Tip	Change your phone language to English for constant practice!	📱	\N	18	t
27	Reading Tip	Reading English books, even children's books, builds vocabulary naturally.	📖	\N	19	t
28	Music Tip	Listen to English songs and look up the lyrics. It's fun and educational!	🎵	\N	20	t
29	Streak Power	Keep your streak alive! Consistency builds habits, and habits build fluency.	🔥	\N	21	t
30	Daily Goal	Just 10 minutes of practice today keeps your skills sharp!	⏰	\N	22	t
31	Commitment	You're here, you're learning, you're growing. That's what matters!	🌟	\N	23	t
\.
